# 5. DEVELOPMENT EXECUTION SEQUENCE

When executing work, follow this exact sequence:

1. **`AGENTS.md`** → Single Source of Truth (Verified & Locked)
2. **Existing Codebase Audit**
3. **Database & Tenant Architecture Verification**
4. **Authentication & Tenant Resolution Layer**
5. **RBAC & Server-Side Security**
6. **Security Event Engine & Attack Detection (Part A)**
7. **Merchant Admin Shell & Layout**
8. **Theme Engine & Bilingual i18n (`বাংলা | English`)**
9. **Core Business Modules (Products, Orders, Inventory, Accounting, Expenses, Marketing, Media & Cloudinary Upload, Map/Location, SEO)**
10. **Smart Inventory, Costing, Sales & Profit Accounting Engine (Part B)**
11. **Private IT Admin System (`/platform`, Security Center & Direct Media Upload)**
12. **Storefront & Host-Based Custom Domain Resolver**
13. **SEO / AEO / GEO Engine**
14. **AI Store Employee Engine (BYOK, 3-Layer Auth, Tool Registry, Approval Cards, Event/Cron Automation)**
15. **Performance, Concurrency & Security Testing**

---

# FINAL GOAL

**Every useful page should be understandable to humans, search engines, and AI systems while remaining fast, secure, accurate, scalable, and genuinely useful.**
